<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>水肿 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E8%82%BF/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.160.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 11:06:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E8%82%BF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>正医法：论肺经生痈 论久嗽服气法 论水泻论血痢 论水肿 论两胁胀满吞酸吐酸 论腰痛 论怔忡不寐</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-1-zhengyifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 10:50:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-1-zhengyifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本文为中医古籍《石室秘录》中“正医法”部分的节选，以岐天师（岐伯）、张公（张仲景）、雷公等问答形式，论述肺、脾、心、肝、肾诸经病症的病因及正治之法。</description></item><item><title>水胀第五十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-57/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 14:33:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-57/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>水，水肿。胀，胸腹胀满。篇中对水肿、肤胀、膨胀、肠覃、石瘕等病证的临床诊断做了鉴别，并且分别论述了这些病证的病因、病机和治疗方法。因文中主要阐述的是以水液运行障碍，导致腹部胀满、眼睑和肢体浮肿为主证的水胀病证的诊断与治疗，故称为&amp;quot;水胀&amp;quot;。</description></item></channel></rss>